    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0087_011e812d7569.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.53913in;height:1.57455in\" /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or <math><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Only <math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi></math> satisfies <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">arg</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />"
